  // fighter can have grid rows for fights the stats file lacks and vice versa. So
  // count them separately — `sn` is the exposure every stats-derived count gets
  // divided by, and using `n` (the grid's fight count) for it would be dividing a
  // number by a denominator drawn from a different set of fights.
